
---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base
  title="Samradh Joshi — Founder of TechMintAI"
  path="/author/"
  description="Meet Samradh Joshi, founder and publisher of TechMintAI, an independent publication covering finance, AI, fintech and technology."
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> / Author
    </div>

    <header class="page-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Behind TechMintAI</span>
      <h1>Samradh Joshi.</h1>
      <p>Founder &amp; Publisher of TechMintAI</p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal">
      <h2>About Samradh</h2>
      <p>
        I'm Samradh Joshi, a developer and Bachelor of Computer
        Applications student with an interest in technology,
        artificial intelligence, fintech and financial education.
      </p>
      <p>
        I founded TechMintAI to make complicated topics easier
        to understand through accessible explanations, practical
        guides and interactive tools.
      </p>

      <h2>What I work on</h2>
      <p>
        My background includes web development, software projects
        and exploring AI-powered tools. At TechMintAI, my role
        includes overseeing the publication and its technical
        development.
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial principles</h2>
      <p>
        TechMintAI aims to explain concepts clearly, use reliable
        sources, identify assumptions and correct mistakes when
        they are discovered. Published content should be reviewed
        for accuracy rather than treated as personalized advice.
      </p>

      <p>
        Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>
        to learn more.
      </p>

      <h2>Financial disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        I am not a licensed financial adviser. TechMintAI provides
        educational information, not personalized financial,
        investment, tax or legal advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For corrections, feedback and editorial inquiries:
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contact}`}>{SITE.contact}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
